Hello everybody,

After finding solution for Xorg server on alpha (thanks to Jay 
Estabrook) we started to work on preparing AC3 isos.
There is a preview version of boot image that could be used to test your 
alpha (could it boot or not). Please, don't
try install mode. Only "rescue" mode is partially working (don't try to 
go to rescue shell when installer asks you to do it -
use second console with the shell).

The test image is available at:
ftp://ftp.rdsor.ro/pub/Linux/Distributions/AlphaLinux/core/3.0b/test/ac3_qboot1.iso

Unfortunatelly, the boot image doesn't contain kernel that could be 
booted by MILO. :(

Please post your test results.

Regards,

